# `sort` with nothing after it: DS0121 with an example, no fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | sort
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..20
  PIPELINE@0..19
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    SORT_OP@15..19
